    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Requires Attunement by a character with renown in the Ashen Verdict.</em></p><p>This metal band is set with five gleaming crystals shaped like a beast's claw. The forge mark of Ormus the Penitent, a stylized O, is stamped inside it.</p><p>While wearing this ring, you gain the following benefits (Ashen Verdict renown required in parentheses).</p><p><strong>Courage (Uncommon, Renown 3+).</strong> You have Advantage on saving throws to avoid or end the Charmed and Frightened conditions.</p><p><strong>Greater Courage (Rare, Renown 10+).</strong> You also gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class.</p><p><strong>Unmatched Courage (Very Rare, Renown 25+).</strong> You also gain a +1 bonus to saving throws.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-NgX7XAHHBOxRa6eP\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll your saves against Charmed and Frightened with Advantage yourself.</p></section>",
